(1040, 1, 'en', 'Increases the attack power reduction of your Demoralizing Roar by 16% and the damage caused by your Ferocious Bite by 6%.'),
(1040, 2, 'en', 'Increases the attack power reduction of your Demoralizing Roar by 24% and the damage caused by your Ferocious Bite by 9%.'),
