(1047, 0, 'en', 'Increases your melee attack power in Cat, Bear and Dire Bear Forms by 50% of your level and 7% of any attack power on your equipped weapon.  In addition, your finishing moves have a 7% chance per combo point to make your next Nature spell with a base casting time less than 10 sec. become an instant cast spell.'),
