(1059, 0, 'en', 'Your Leader of the Pack ability also causes affected targets to heal themselves for 2% of their total health when they critically hit with a melee or ranged attack.  The healing effect cannot occur more than once every 6 sec.  In addition, you gain 4% of your maximum mana when you benefit from this heal.'),
(1059, 1, 'en', 'Your Leader of the Pack ability also causes affected targets to heal themselves for 4% of their total health when they critically hit with a melee or ranged attack.  The healing effect cannot occur more than once every 6 sec.  In addition, you gain 8% of your maximum mana when you benefit from this heal.'),
(1055, 0, 'en', 'Reduces the duration of fear effects by 10%, reduces all damage taken while stunned by 10% while in Cat Form.'),
(1055, 1, 'en', 'Reduces the duration of fear effects by 20%, reduces all damage taken while stunned by 20% while in Cat Form.'),
(1055, 2, 'en', 'Reduces the duration of fear effects by 30%, reduces all damage taken while stunned by 30% while in Cat Form.'),
(1066, 0, 'en', 'Increases your attack power by 2% and reduces the damage you take by 4%, while in Bear or Dire Bear Form.'),
