(1066, 2, 'en', 'Increases your attack power by 6% and reduces the damage you take by 12%, while in Bear or Dire Bear Form.'),
(1057, 0, 'en', 'While in Cat Form increases your damage from melee critical strikes by 3% and reduces the damage taken from area of effect attacks by 10%.'),
