(1068, 0, 'en', 'Grants the periodic damage from your Lacerate and Rip abilities the ability to critically hit.'),
(1065, 0, 'en', 'When activated, this ability causes your Mangle (Bear) ability to hit up to 3 targets and have no cooldown, and reduces the energy cost of all your Cat Form abilities by 50%.  Lasts 15 sec.  You cannot use Tiger''s Fury while Berserk is active. 

Clears the effect of Fear and makes you immune to Fear for the duration.'),
