(1296, 0, 'en', 'Places a Blessing on the friendly target, reducing damage taken from all sources by 3% for 10 min and increasing strength and stamina by 10%.  In addition, when the target blocks, parries, or dodges a melee attack the target will gain 2% of maximum displayed mana.  Players may only have one Blessing on them per Paladin at any one time.'),
