(1609, 1, 'en', 'Your Corruption and Unstable Affliction spells gain an additional 2% of your bonus spell damage, and your Drain Life, Drain Soul, Shadow Bolt, and Haunt spells have a 40% chance to reset the duration of your Corruption spell on the target.'),
