(1609, 3, 'en', 'Your Corruption and Unstable Affliction spells gain an additional 4% of your bonus spell damage, and your Drain Life, Drain Soul, Shadow Bolt, and Haunt spells have a 80% chance to reset the duration of your Corruption spell on the target.'),
