(1611, 0, 'en', 'You send a ghostly soul into the target, dealing 405 to 473 Shadow damage and increasing all damage done by your Shadow damage-over-time effects on the target by 20% for 12 sec. When the Haunt spell ends or is dispelled, the soul returns to you, healing you for 100% of the damage it did to the target.'),
(1614, 0, 'en', 'Increases the amount of Health restored by your Healthstone by 10%.'),
(1614, 1, 'en', 'Increases the amount of Health restored by your Healthstone by 20%.'),
(1615, 0, 'en', 'Increases the effect of your Imp''s Firebolt, Fire Shield, and Blood Pact spells by 10%.'),
(1615, 1, 'en', 'Increases the effect of your Imp''s Firebolt, Fire Shield, and Blood Pact spells by 20%.'),
(1615, 2, 'en', 'Increases the effect of your Imp''s Firebolt, Fire Shield, and Blood Pact spells by 30%.'),
