(1822, 0, 'en', 'The Death Knight is surrounded by 3 whirling bones. While at least 1 bone remains, they takes 20% less damage from all sources and deals 2% more damage with all attacks, spells and abilities. Each damaging attack that lands consumes 1 bone. Lasts 5 minutes.'),
(1819, 0, 'en', 'When your diseases damage an enemy, there is a chance equal to your melee critical strike chance that they will cause 33% additional damage to the target and all enemies within 8 yards.  Ignores any target under the effect of a spell that is cancelled by taking damage.'),
